"\n<header><a class=\"brand\" href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Xenit Realty home\"><img class=\"xenit-wordmark\" src=\"/xenit-logo.svg\" alt=\"Xenit Realty\" width=\"290\" height=\"64\"></a><button class=\"menu\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Menu <span><svg class=\"icon icon-menu\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\"/></svg><svg class=\"icon icon-menu-close\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"m6 6 12 12M6 18 18 6\"/></svg></span></button><nav><span aria-disabled=\"true\" class=\"nav-disabled\">Find a home</span><a href=\"#approach\">Our approach</a><a href=\"#owners\">For property owners</a><a class=\"nav-cta\" href=\"/portal\">Tenant Portal <span><svg class=\"icon icon-arrow-up-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"/></svg></span></a></nav></header>\n<main><section class=\"hero\"><img src=\"/hero.jpg\" alt=\"Light-filled contemporary living room with natural textures and generous seating\" fetchpriority=\"high\"><div class=\"hero-shade\"></div><div class=\"hero-content\"><div class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"dot\"></span> GOOD HOMES. BETTER LIVING.</div><h1>Find your<br><em>perfect home.</em></h1><p>Bringing landlords and tenants together through thoughtful<br>apartment leasing, rental support, and property management.</p><a class=\"button light\" href=\"/portal\">Enter Tenant Portal <span><svg class=\"icon icon-arrow-up-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"/></svg></span></a></div><div class=\"hero-bottom\"><span>ROOM FOR YOUR NEXT CHAPTER</span><a href=\"#approach\">Discover the difference <span><svg class=\"icon icon-arrow-down\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M12 4v16m-7-7 7 7 7-7\"/></svg></span></a></div></section>\n<section class=\"search-wrap\" aria-label=\"Find a rental\"><form id=\"search\"><label>WHERE DO YOU WANT TO LIVE?<select id=\"city\"><option value=\"all\">Explore all locations</option>Austin, TX</option>Charlotte, NC</option>Denver, CO</option></select></label><label>YOUR SPACE<select id=\"beds\"><option value=\"all\">Any bedrooms</option value=\"1\">1 bedroom</option><option value=\"2\">2 bedrooms</option><option value=\"3\">3 bedrooms</option></select></label><label>MONTHLY RENT<select id=\"budget\"><option value=\"all\">Any budget</option value=\"2000\">Up to $2,000</option><option value=\"2500\">Up to $2,500</option><option value=\"3000\">Up to $3,000</option></select></label><button class=\"button dark\">Explore homes <span><svg class=\"icon icon-arrow-up-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"/></svg></span></button></form></section>\n<section class=\"intro section\" id=\"approach\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">01 / A MORE CONSIDERED WAY TO LIVE</div><div><h2>Your partner in<br><span>property management.</span></h2><div class=\"intro-copy\"><p>Xenit Realty connects property owners with people looking for a place to call home. Our approach brings apartment leasing, rental coordination, and property care together\u2014online and in person.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"#process\">Get to know our approach <span><svg class=\"icon icon-arrow-up-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"/></svg></span></a></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"homes section\" id=\"homes\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">02 / FIND YOUR EVERYDAY</div><h2>Somewhere that feels like you.</h2></div><button class=\"text-link\" id=\"reset\">Reset filters <span><svg class=\"icon icon-arrow-up-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"/></svg></span></button></div><div class=\"listing-note\">A glimpse of what\u2019s possible \u00b7 Browse current availability</div><div class=\"property-grid\">\n<article class=\"property\" data-city=\"Austin, TX\" data-beds=\"2\" data-price=\"2350\"><a class=\"property-photo\" href=\"/properties/the-willow\"><img src=\"/home-1.jpg\" alt=\"Airy living space with modern furnishings\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"badge\">EXAMPLE RESIDENCE</span><span class=\"round\"><svg class=\"icon icon-arrow-up-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"/></svg></span></a><div class=\"property-title\"><h3>The Willow</h3><span>$2,350<small> / mo</small></span></div><p>Austin, TX</p><div class=\"specs\">2 beds <i></i> 2 baths <i></i> 1,240 sq ft</div></article>\n<article class=\"property\" data-city=\"Charlotte, NC\" data-beds=\"1\" data-price=\"1850\"><a class=\"property-photo\" href=\"/properties/parkside-residence\"><img src=\"/home-2.jpg\" alt=\"Warm neutral apartment interior with a comfortable sofa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"badge\">EXAMPLE RESIDENCE</span><span class=\"round\"><svg class=\"icon icon-arrow-up-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"/></svg></span></a><div class=\"property-title\"><h3>Parkside Residence</h3><span>$1,850<small> / mo</small></span></div><p>Charlotte, NC</p><div class=\"specs\">1 bed <i></i> 1 bath <i></i> 860 sq ft</div></article>\n<article class=\"property\" data-city=\"Denver, CO\" data-beds=\"3\" data-price=\"2950\"><a class=\"property-photo\" href=\"/properties/the-juniper\"><img src=\"/home-3.jpg\" alt=\"Refined apartment with an open living and dining area\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"badge\">EXAMPLE RESIDENCE</span><span class=\"round\"><svg class=\"icon icon-arrow-up-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"/></svg></span></a><div class=\"property-title\"><h3>The Juniper</h3><span>$2,950<small> / mo</small></span></div><p>Denver, CO</p><div class=\"specs\">3 beds <i></i> 2 baths <i></i> 1,580 sq ft</div></article></div><p id=\"results\" role=\"status\"></p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/properties\">Explore the full collection</a></section>\n<section class=\"difference\"><div class=\"difference-image\"><img src=\"/detail.jpg\" alt=\"Carefully styled living room with wood accents and soft natural light\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"image-caption\">THE DETAILS MAKE THE DIFFERENCE.</div></div><div class=\"difference-copy\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">DESIGNED AROUND REAL LIFE</div><h2>Simpler renting.<br>Thoughtful management.</h2><p>Our mission is to make renting easier for everyone. For owners, that means caring for their property. For tenants, it means welcoming homes and clear communication.</p><div class=\"feature\"><span>01</span><div><h3>Spaces worth coming home to</h3><p>Practical layouts, welcoming interiors, and room to make it your own.</p></div></div><div class=\"feature\"><span>02</span><div><h3>People, not just properties</h3><p>Clear communication and a personal approach to the place you call home.</p></div></div><div class=\"feature\"><span>03</span><div><h3>Less friction. More living.</h3><p>A straightforward rental journey, with guidance at every step.</p></div></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"process section\" id=\"process\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">03 / YOUR NEXT CHAPTER, SIMPLIFIED</div><h2>How it works.</h2><div class=\"steps\"><article><span class=\"step-number\">01</span><h3>Find your home.</h3><p>Explore homes by location, space, and budget. Find the one that feels right for you.</p></article><article><span class=\"step-number\">02</span><h3>Create your account.</h3><p>Enter the tenant portal and create your profile. Keep your account in one convenient place.</p></article><article><span class=\"step-number\">03</span><h3>Welcome home.</h3><p>When a home is available, connect with the team about the application, lease, and move-in arrangements.</p></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"owner section\" id=\"owners\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">FOR PROPERTY OWNERS</div><h2>Connecting owners.<br>Welcoming tenants.</h2></div><div><p>From leasing support to day-to-day property care, our approach is built around owners and residents. Let\u2019s discuss your property and the support you\u2019re looking for.</p><a href=\"#contact\" class=\"button light\">Let\u2019s discuss your property <span><svg class=\"icon icon-arrow-up-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"/></svg></span></a></div></section>\n<section class=\"faq section\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">A FEW THINGS TO KNOW</div><h2>A clearer path<br>to your next home.</h2></div><div class=\"questions\"><details><summary>How do I create a tenant account?<span><svg class=\"icon icon-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg></span></summary><p>Select Enter Tenant Portal to open the sign-in form, then choose Sign Up to create an account using your email and password. Registration will open once account services are connected.</p></details><details><summary>Will I receive an email after signup?<span><svg class=\"icon icon-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg></span></summary><p>Once account services launch, new tenants will receive a welcome email after signing up. Registration and email delivery are currently being set up.</p></details><details><summary>Can I pay rent in the portal?<span><svg class=\"icon icon-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg></span></summary><p>The tenant portal is being prepared for launch. Rent payments, lease management, and maintenance requests are not available yet.</p></details><details><summary>Do you work with property owners?<span><svg class=\"icon icon-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg></span></summary><p>We support both renters and property owners with thoughtful leasing and property management.</p></details></div></section>\n<section class=\"contact section\" id=\"contact\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">LET\u2019S START SOMETHING GOOD</div><h2>Your next chapter<br>starts with <em>hello.</em></h2><p>Create your tenant profile and take the first step toward your next home.</p><div class=\"contact-actions\"><a class=\"button dark\" href=\"/portal\">Enter Tenant Portal <span><svg class=\"icon icon-arrow-up-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"/></svg></span></a><button class=\"button outline\" data-inquiry=\"property\">I own a property <span><svg class=\"icon icon-arrow-up-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"/></svg></span></button></div></section>\n</main><footer><div class=\"footer-top\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"#\"><img class=\"xenit-wordmark\" src=\"/xenit-logo.svg\" alt=\"Xenit Realty\" width=\"290\" height=\"64\"></a><p>Good homes. Thoughtful care.<br>Room for what comes next.</p><div><a href=\"#homes\">Find a home <svg class=\"icon icon-arrow-up-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"/></svg></a><a href=\"#owners\">For property owners <svg class=\"icon icon-arrow-up-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"/></svg></a><a href=\"#contact\">Get in touch <svg class=\"icon icon-arrow-up-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"/></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"footer-bottom\"><span>\u00a9 <span id=\"year\">2026</span> Xenit Realty</span><span>Equal Housing Opportunity</span><span>Property & Living \u00b7 United States</span></div></footer>\n<dialog id=\"modal\"><button class=\"close\" aria-label=\"Close dialog\"><svg class=\"icon icon-close\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"m6 6 12 12M6 18 18 6\"/></svg></button><div id=\"modal-content\"></div></dialog>"